  "post_title": "Nueva campaña de Onda Centre Comercial \"et puja a la Fira\" en Pascua",
  "post_date": "2015-03-13 16:34:22",
  "post_name": "nueva-campana-de-onda-centre-comercial-et-puja-a-la-fira-en-pascua",
